  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Header.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"705\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">此模組使用由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superoreblock\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>SuperOreBlock</strong></span></em></a> 引入的全新「超級礦石方塊」，新增了一套升級版的武器、工具和護甲。這些新物品的數值略高於原版對應物品，提供自然的強度提升，但不會過於強力而破壞平衡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你需要伺服器來和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Promo.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"285\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或整合包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是你的最佳選擇！他們提供最具性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用優惠碼「Lupin」即可享有 25% 折扣。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Description.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"190\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">功能特色：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">由<strong>超級鐵</strong>、<strong>超級金</strong>、<strong>超級鑽石</strong>以及<strong>超級下界合金方塊</strong>製成的全新護甲套裝。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">與一般裝備相比數值略有提升&mdash;&mdash;設計上力求帶來成就感同時保持平衡。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">物品可透過<strong>鍛造台</strong>進行升級：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">將標準物品（例如鐵胸甲或鑽石劍）與對應的超級方塊合併，即可製作其強化版本。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此模組非常適合尋求額外裝備階級，且能無縫融入原版風格進度系統的玩家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Faq.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"190\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它能在伺服器上使用嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然可以！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式就是使用 BisectHosting，並且透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結即可享有 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模組能否用於整合包中？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！只要僅發布於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 平台即可。上傳至任何其他平台皆屬侵犯我們權益的行為，嚴格禁止。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我們將不勝感激。若需要任何微調或有其他疑問，歡迎隨時聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製關於此模組的影片並在頻道中展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，您完全可以自由地在您的頻道中遊玩此模組或我們的任何整合包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會對此感到非常感激！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"189\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/280/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/282/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/284/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/285/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></span></p>",
